<title>MEXICO: Mexico's Pemex list Q1 crude prices by region.</title>
<headline>Mexico's Pemex list Q1 crude prices by region.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexico's state oil and gas monopoly Petroleos Mexicanos (Pemex) reported its 1996 average prices for crude exports by region and brand.</p>
<p>Figures in dollars per barrel.</p>
<p>    Item		  Q1 1996	   Q1 1997</p>
<p>  Export Basket	  16.97	     18.45</p>
<p>    Olmeca		 19.13	     22.15</p>
<p>    Isthmus		18.03	     20.54</p>
<p>    Maya		   15.49	     16.11</p>
<p>  Western Hemisphere   17.12	     18.79</p>
<p>    Olmeca		 19.13	     22.15</p>
<p>    Isthmus		18.52	     20.82</p>
<p>    Maya		   15.56	     16.39</p>
<p>  Europe		   15.17	     15.03</p>
<p>    Isthmus		17.11	     17.97</p>
<p>    Maya		   15.01	     14.82</p>
<p>  Asia		     16.98	     20.36</p>
<p>    Isthmus		17.30	     20.58</p>
<p>    Maya		   15.21	     15.23</p>
<p>((--Timna Tanners, Mexico City newsroom +525 728-7903))</p>
</text>
